<meta name="description" content="The method chapter, written last so it could report what happened. Eighty-two graded rows across eight essays, six MISSes, one verdict never used once, and a dating error the book carried in its own kickers for a week. Lem asked for this edition in 1991; here is what building it actually cost.">
