    54	<tr><td>The same selector applied to the other two classes he names — "a low level of intelligence, or with unstable personalities (which raises some doubts, at least for the time being)" (p. 345)</td><td>Not by that device. Nobody is screened out of a marriage on predicted intelligence; the trait menu appears instead in polygenic scoring of IVF embryos, a different mechanism on a different object <!-- CHECK: nucleus-embryo-2025 --> <!-- CHECK: embryo-screening-2024 --></td><td class="verdict v-early">EARLY</td></tr>
